      "period": "classical",
      "gloss": "a place, a space",
      "comment": "A plain place: <span lang=\"la\">locum quaerimus</span>, we’re looking for a space; <span lang=\"la\">locus vacuus</span>, a free one. To park is <span lang=\"la\">autoraedam statuere</span>, and the car park <span lang=\"la\">ārea statīva</span> (Traupman 217)."
    },
    {
      "latin": "spatium, spatiī n.",
      "status": "alternative",
      "period": "classical",
      "gloss": "a space, room",
      "evidence": [
        "Andresian p. 41"
      ],
      "comment": "Room, a space (Lewis &amp; Short); Andresian’s picture seems to show a car turning into a space. Less definite than <span lang=\"la\">locus</span>, and also the word for a stretch of time."
    }
  ],
